### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create Order (Triggers Saga -> order-created-topic)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/order/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: CASHIER-01
X-User-Role: ROLE_CASHIER

{
  "discountAmount": 500000,
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "LAPTOP-MBP-14",
      "productName": "MacBook Pro",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 25000000
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Get All Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order/orders
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order/orders/1
Accept: application/json
